    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίβος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό,
			ʽλείβὠ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιβάς</span>
			, in pl., <i>tears</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				448
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίπος</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσταγμά τι τῶν
				ὀμμάτων</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.118
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			= Lat. <i>libum</i>, Chrysipp.Tyan. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.647d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.126a
			</span></i>.</div>
